#     ("• 장점: ..." / "• 단점: ...", owner 15:00 / 17:18: no traffic-light
#     markers, no +/-, no dash) -- so calendar and option buttons stay in ONE
#     message.
#   * a functional direction (a strand on a program-computed measure) adds
#     what every session carries beyond the lifts (CARE_ITEMS): emitted as
#     `care` data and written onto the card (program.yaml `care:`, through
#     program-init) -- in the consult they are the mat-prep and cooldown
#     slots of every session (round 3), not a block of their own -- so
